---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Mandy Chen | AI-Native Backend Engineer"
  description="Mandy Chen — AI-Native Backend Engineer, Kaohsiung, Taiwan"
>
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">Hello, I'm</div>
    <h1>Mandy Chen</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">AI-Native Backend Engineer</p>
    <p class="location">📍 Kaohsiung, Taiwan</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      數學系出身的軟體工程師,喜歡處理「既要能證明、也要能上線」的問題。
      目前在 NYCU DPS 攻讀在職碩士,同時進行 NLP 相關研究。
    </p>
    <p>
      專注於後端架構與雲原生基礎設施,也持續在探索用 Claude Code、OpenAI Codex
      等工具打造 AI 驅動的開發流程 —— 從 spec-driven development 到搭配自訂 agent
      的分階段交付機制。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Currently</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="role">Backend Engineer <span class="org">@ Trendlink</span></div>
      <p class="card-note">
        雲端人資與績效管理平台
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Tech Stack</h2>

    <div class="tag-group">
      <div class="tag-group-label">Languages</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="tag">Python</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tag-group">
      <div class="tag-group-label">Backend</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
        <span class="tag">Express</span>
        <span class="tag">NestJS</span>
        <span class="tag">Django</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tag-group">
      <div class="tag-group-label">Frontend</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">React</span>
        <span class="tag">Vue.js</span>
        <span class="tag">HTML5</span>
        <span class="tag">CSS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tag-group">
      <div class="tag-group-label">Databases</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="tag">MySQL</span>
        <span class="tag">MongoDB</span>
        <span class="tag">Redis</span>
        <span class="tag">SQLite</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tag-group">
      <div class="tag-group-label">DevOps / Cloud</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Docker</span>
        <span class="tag">Kubernetes</span>
        <span class="tag">NGINX</span>
        <span class="tag">Google Cloud</span>
        <span class="tag">Git</span>
        <span class="tag">Linux</span>
        <span class="tag">Bash</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tag-group">
      <div class="tag-group-label">Testing &amp; Design</div>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Jest</span>
        <span class="tag">Cypress</span>
        <span class="tag">Figma</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="link-btn" href="mailto:ms.mandy610425@gmail.com">✉️ Email</a>
      <a class="link-btn" href="https://github.com/singyichen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a class="link-btn" href="https://linkedin.com/in/sing-yi-chen" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="link-btn" href="https://medium.com/@ms-mandy610425" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Medium</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
